# Responsive UI Guardrails

## Layout checks

Verify usability below 768px (test at 375px and 768px widths).
Touch targets: minimum 44x44px (use `--size-touch-target` token).
Use `dvh`/`svh` with `vh` fallback for dynamic viewport height.
Account for notches with `env(safe-area-inset-*)`.
Compact layout for `@media (pointer: fine)`.
Off-canvas drawers: keyboard dismissible, focus trapped (WAI-ARIA dialog pattern).
Print media: hide non-essential UI with `@media print`.

## System preference media queries (all required)

- `prefers-color-scheme: dark` — Dark theme.
- `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` — Disable animations/transitions (WCAG 2.3.3).
- `prefers-contrast: more` — Thicken borders, strengthen focus rings (WCAG 1.4.11).
- `forced-colors: active` — Map to OS system colors (Windows High Contrast).
- `prefers-reduced-transparency: reduce` — Replace semi-transparent with opaque values.

## Design tokens

Use CSS custom properties as design tokens. Never hardcode visual values.
Required categories: spacing (`--space-*`), font sizes (`--font-size-*`), colors (`--color-*`), borders (`--border-*`), touch targets (`--size-touch-target`), focus (`--focus-ring-*`), z-index (`--z-*`).
